contentText:
Aespa talks about their collab with Ty Dolla $ign &#8220;Switchblade,&#8221; performing songs from their recent album Lemonade at Lollapalooza and their upcoming tour.

NINGNING&nbsp;&nbsp;

We are all Ty Dolla $ign fans. I love his music since I was very, since a very long time ago. I&#8217;m so happy when I heard we can have a collaboration with him, and also we shot a music video with him. She came to Korea, and we had a very great time together. So I&#8217;m very happy and very excited to perform with him.

Winter&nbsp;

A lot of our most recent songs have a style and feel that we really like, and many of them also give us a lot to express through our performances on stage. The new songs we&#8217;re revealing today are also very powerful and addictive and, I think they&#8217;re the kind of songs the audience can enjoy along with us.

Karina&nbsp;

First of all, a lot of songs from our Lemonade album are included in the setlist, so I think our fans will really enjoy it. We&#8217;re also really excited to meet our fans all around the world. We&#8217;ll be coming to see you soon, so please look forward to it!
